1
00:00:00,013 --> 00:00:01,494
(This drama complied with production
guidelines for filming child actors,)

2
00:00:01,496 --> 00:00:03,013
(and some scenes used
generative AI technology.)

3
00:00:03,506 --> 00:00:06,099
(Episode 89)

4
00:00:39,838 --> 00:00:44,352
Jung A, please help us
get rid of Na Ji Ni.

5
00:00:53,137 --> 00:00:54,450
(Ji Ni)

6
00:00:54,745 --> 00:00:56,784
Did you go out again?
Will you be home late?

7
00:00:57,285 --> 00:01:00,011
Can we talk? I'm sorry about earlier.

8
00:01:00,878 --> 00:01:03,510
Your very existence
is a burden and a nuisance.

9
00:01:04,758 --> 00:01:06,318
You clueless brat!

10
00:01:06,896 --> 00:01:08,609
(Power off)

11
00:01:28,512 --> 00:01:29,808
Stay by yourself all you want.

12
00:01:30,252 --> 00:01:32,221
I won't bother you
until you've cooled off.

13
00:01:42,918 --> 00:01:45,928
The person you're calling is unavailable.
Please leave a message...

14
00:02:00,245 --> 00:02:02,030
Wake me up, even if you get home late.

15
00:02:02,392 --> 00:02:03,636
We need to talk.

16
00:02:22,998 --> 00:02:25,261
Mother, when did you get home?

17
00:02:26,078 --> 00:02:28,236
And look who's finally
come out of her room.

18
00:02:28,592 --> 00:02:30,725
You've had me walking on eggshells.

19
00:02:31,703 --> 00:02:33,675
- I'm sorry.
- It's okay.

20
00:02:34,425 --> 00:02:36,543
Luckily, we're not so short-staffed...

21
00:02:37,089 --> 00:02:39,109
that I'd make you work
after you'd been stabbed.

22
00:02:39,657 --> 00:02:41,424
So, where's Ji Hu?

23
00:02:41,425 --> 00:02:43,513
He's probably already left for work.

24
00:02:44,592 --> 00:02:46,515
I felt sorry for my son,
having you treat him so badly,

25
00:02:46,516 --> 00:02:48,105
so I booked him a hotel.

26
00:02:48,318 --> 00:02:51,518
He's been sleeping on the couch upstairs
or in his uncle's room.

27
00:02:52,805 --> 00:02:54,481
What kind of life is that?

28
00:03:00,765 --> 00:03:01,765
A hotel?

29
00:03:07,205 --> 00:03:11,500
The phone is turned off.
Please leave a message after the beep...

30
00:03:13,142 --> 00:03:14,142
What?

31
00:03:21,585 --> 00:03:23,398
- Yes.
- Ji Hu.

32
00:03:23,602 --> 00:03:24,653
You should get up.

33
00:03:25,212 --> 00:03:27,042
You were sleeping so soundly
that I didn't wake you.

34
00:03:30,986 --> 00:03:33,565
- I slept in.
- You've been exhausted lately.

35
00:03:33,945 --> 00:03:35,662
I'm glad you got one good night's sleep.

36
00:03:35,663 --> 00:03:36,877
Hurry up and get to work.

37
00:03:37,069 --> 00:03:40,276
Ji Ni seems to be sleeping well too.
Maybe the herbal tonic is helping.

38
00:03:40,475 --> 00:03:42,352
Don't call her. You might wake her.

39
00:03:43,512 --> 00:03:44,675
Okay, Mom.

40
00:03:45,331 --> 00:03:46,781
Thank you for looking out for us.

41
00:03:47,362 --> 00:03:48,362
Okay.

42
00:04:08,058 --> 00:04:10,435
- Ma'am.
- Jung A.

43
00:04:11,457 --> 00:04:12,457
You're here.

44
00:04:14,231 --> 00:04:17,034
You sweet thing! You're amazing!

45
00:04:17,294 --> 00:04:18,294
What did I do?

46
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:25,600
How is it?

47
00:04:25,775 --> 00:04:26,968
You're ready, right?

48
00:04:27,700 --> 00:04:29,424
Let's go all out, okay?

49
00:04:29,618 --> 00:04:30,618
Okay.

50
00:04:31,452 --> 00:04:34,098
But how did you know we'd fall asleep?

51
00:04:36,855 --> 00:04:39,623
- Did you...
- I always keep sleeping pills on hand.

52
00:04:40,214 --> 00:04:42,816
- Ma'am.
- You'll need to be fully prepared too.

53
00:04:43,378 --> 00:04:44,378
Okay?

54
00:04:45,886 --> 00:04:47,588
Why? What were you going to say?

55
00:04:50,305 --> 00:04:51,305
Nothing.

56
00:04:52,134 --> 00:04:53,582
From now on, I'll follow your lead.

57
00:04:53,634 --> 00:04:55,648
Good. That's how it should be.

58
00:04:57,005 --> 00:05:00,048
Yesterday, when I was alone with Ji Hu,

59
00:05:00,689 --> 00:05:02,470
I felt so happy and at ease.

60
00:05:03,925 --> 00:05:05,904
I really want to become
your daughter-in-law.

61
00:05:06,059 --> 00:05:07,784
- Please guide me.
- Okay.

62
00:05:08,352 --> 00:05:09,418
Just follow my lead.

63
00:05:12,151 --> 00:05:13,551
- Welcome!
- Hello.

64
00:05:15,225 --> 00:05:17,481
- Can I help you find anything?
- I'm looking for comfortable sneakers.

65
00:05:23,152 --> 00:05:25,620
What's wrong? Are you not feeling well?

66
00:05:25,824 --> 00:05:27,920
Yeah. Maybe it's because I drank a little.

67
00:05:28,098 --> 00:05:29,825
My head is killing me. I'm dizzy too.

68
00:05:30,145 --> 00:05:31,712
How much did you drink?

69
00:05:32,305 --> 00:05:34,558
Ji Ni's sick,
and you were out getting drunk?

70
00:05:34,758 --> 00:05:36,635
I only had one glass of whiskey.

71
00:05:36,785 --> 00:05:38,265
And you're this bad after just one glass?

72
00:05:39,418 --> 00:05:40,898
My head feels like it's going to explode.

73
00:05:40,900 --> 00:05:42,904
Are you sure someone didn't spike
your drink?

74
00:05:43,339 --> 00:05:44,339
What?

75
00:05:44,532 --> 00:05:45,940
I was with Mom and Jung A.

76
00:05:45,942 --> 00:05:47,307
Were you with them again?

77
00:05:47,707 --> 00:05:49,795
Unbelievable! What about Ji Ni?

78
00:05:50,064 --> 00:05:51,064
Ji Ni?

79
00:05:52,465 --> 00:05:53,743
I can't get close to her yet.

80
00:05:53,745 --> 00:05:55,207
So you're just going to leave her alone?

81
00:05:55,452 --> 00:05:56,685
This is so frustrating.

82
00:05:56,725 --> 00:05:59,051
Then what am I supposed to do?
Her door's always closed.

83
00:05:59,898 --> 00:06:01,506
I can't keep waiting forever.

84
00:06:02,438 --> 00:06:04,765
You think it's easy for me
to just sit back and wait?

85
00:06:04,767 --> 00:06:06,433
Then why do you keep involving Jung A?

86
00:06:07,445 --> 00:06:10,027
Your mom seems to like
having Jung A around,

87
00:06:10,175 --> 00:06:12,549
but don't do it.
It could cause problems later.

88
00:06:13,858 --> 00:06:15,669
I don't have time to worry about that.

89
00:06:16,590 --> 00:06:18,550
- Ji Hu.
- Yeah? What?

90
00:06:20,538 --> 00:06:22,295
Jung A used to have feelings for you.

91
00:06:23,035 --> 00:06:24,128
You didn't know, did you?

92
00:06:24,938 --> 00:06:26,563
Be careful, even when you're
with your mom.

93
00:06:27,431 --> 00:06:31,108
I hope I'm just worrying over nothing,
but you never know.

94
00:06:31,432 --> 00:06:34,209
That was in the past.
She's my wife's friend now.

95
00:06:36,194 --> 00:06:37,310
Thanks for looking out for me.

96
00:06:46,358 --> 00:06:47,858
So no one's home?

97
00:06:48,101 --> 00:06:49,913
Yeah. Sorry.

98
00:06:50,180 --> 00:06:53,459
I should've come to pick you up,
but Mom and I were both busy.

99
00:06:53,612 --> 00:06:55,014
See you tonight, Seung Hyun.

100
00:06:55,160 --> 00:06:56,281
Okay. See you.

101
00:07:08,205 --> 00:07:09,602
One, two, three!

102
00:07:12,110 --> 00:07:13,379
Got you!

103
00:07:14,114 --> 00:07:15,884
Seung Hyun, have a bite.

104
00:07:15,885 --> 00:07:17,989
Here's to never having to set foot
in a police station again!

105
00:07:18,310 --> 00:07:19,310
Okay.

106
00:07:21,338 --> 00:07:23,809
Seung Hyun, glad you're home safe.

107
00:07:24,172 --> 00:07:26,020
Welcome home, you troublemaker.

108
00:07:26,525 --> 00:07:28,931
Is this really something to celebrate?
It feels strange.

109
00:07:28,933 --> 00:07:31,457
What's strange about it?
Everything worked out.

110
00:07:31,459 --> 00:07:32,688
It's worth celebrating.

111
00:07:32,690 --> 00:07:34,212
Just imagine if Lee Cheol had really died.

112
00:07:34,214 --> 00:07:35,600
I don't even want to think about it.

113
00:07:36,525 --> 00:07:37,525
Mom.

114
00:07:40,158 --> 00:07:42,185
I'm so relieved.

115
00:07:43,912 --> 00:07:45,075
I'll get going.

116
00:07:45,612 --> 00:07:48,205
Enjoy your mother-son reunion.

117
00:07:48,518 --> 00:07:50,425
Did you leave the clinic
just because of me?

118
00:07:50,592 --> 00:07:52,370
I just stepped out during my lunch break.

119
00:07:52,372 --> 00:07:53,863
That's not all.

120
00:07:53,865 --> 00:07:55,230
I even left home because of you.

121
00:07:55,232 --> 00:07:57,067
I've been running all over town for you.

122
00:07:57,492 --> 00:08:00,429
You've put me through a lot.
You'll make it up to me later.

123
00:08:01,150 --> 00:08:02,288
Okay.

124
00:08:02,798 --> 00:08:04,610
- Yeong Ju.
- Yes. Take care.

125
00:08:04,778 --> 00:08:06,400
Seriously!

126
00:08:09,178 --> 00:08:10,488
- Let's go inside.
- Okay.

127
00:08:23,565 --> 00:08:24,565
Mai,

128
00:08:25,424 --> 00:08:26,834
looking at this empty room,

129
00:08:27,311 --> 00:08:30,691
for once, I'm glad you're not here.

130
00:08:31,551 --> 00:08:32,859
All of this...

131
00:08:33,649 --> 00:08:35,536
would've been too much for you.

132
00:08:36,838 --> 00:08:38,315
But if you were here,

133
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:40,770
I wouldn't feel so alone.

134
00:09:04,871 --> 00:09:07,520
- Come eat, Seung Hyun.
- Okay.

135
00:09:18,565 --> 00:09:21,209
How's life away from home?
Having a hard time?

136
00:09:22,365 --> 00:09:23,462
You have no idea.

137
00:09:24,194 --> 00:09:27,374
I didn't think I'd be eating
Mom's stew again so soon.

138
00:09:27,462 --> 00:09:28,571
I'm really sorry.

139
00:09:28,572 --> 00:09:30,743
Well, it's all behind us now.

140
00:09:31,005 --> 00:09:34,164
Put what happened with Seung Woo
behind you and focus on your own life.

141
00:09:34,629 --> 00:09:35,755
Focus on yourself.

142
00:09:36,265 --> 00:09:38,015
You know I've been running the cafe
all this time, right?

143
00:09:38,292 --> 00:09:41,261
We only closed today.
You take over again starting tomorrow.

144
00:09:41,604 --> 00:09:42,722
Coffee Prince.

145
00:09:44,321 --> 00:09:46,399
Okay. I'll get back to my old life.

146
00:09:47,018 --> 00:09:49,083
Mom, you can go home now too.

147
00:09:49,525 --> 00:09:53,358
Okay. I just want to forget everything
and move on now.

148
00:09:54,225 --> 00:09:56,358
You think Mom stayed because of you?

149
00:09:57,265 --> 00:09:58,791
She didn't come for you.

150
00:10:00,102 --> 00:10:01,691
She came to avoid Ji Ni.

151
00:10:04,425 --> 00:10:07,902
The gold from our house
paid for Ji Ni's wedding.

152
00:10:08,712 --> 00:10:11,765
I feel torn between being uncomfortable
and being grateful.

153
00:10:11,798 --> 00:10:12,892
I don't want to see her.

154
00:10:14,165 --> 00:10:17,190
I just wish we could all forget
and move on with our lives.

155
00:10:21,991 --> 00:10:25,054
Ji Ni isn't doing well.

156
00:10:26,098 --> 00:10:29,065
It seems she's completely cut ties
with her mom.

157
00:10:29,592 --> 00:10:32,278
She had a miscarriage,
and she's a complete mess.

158
00:10:33,105 --> 00:10:34,403
She even pushed Ji Hu away.

159
00:10:34,589 --> 00:10:36,392
Really? Did you see her?

160
00:10:38,338 --> 00:10:41,226
Mom did everything she could for Ji Ni.

161
00:10:41,492 --> 00:10:44,431
Maybe that's why she says
she has no regrets now,

162
00:10:44,920 --> 00:10:46,154
but I can't say the same.

163
00:10:46,945 --> 00:10:49,152
I keep thinking about the time
we went to see Lee Cheol.

164
00:10:49,768 --> 00:10:50,986
So I went to see her.

165
00:10:51,264 --> 00:10:52,931
I used picking up the painting
as an excuse.

166
00:10:53,698 --> 00:10:54,711
Tell me everything.

167
00:10:55,345 --> 00:10:56,443
Remember before...

168
00:10:56,572 --> 00:10:58,820
when she shut herself in her room
because of Ji Hu?

169
00:10:59,039 --> 00:11:00,097
It's worse now.

170
00:11:00,306 --> 00:11:01,952
Seung Hyun, what should we do?

171
00:11:02,674 --> 00:11:03,952
Should we really...

172
00:11:04,173 --> 00:11:06,200
live as if we're strangers to each other?

173
00:11:06,552 --> 00:11:08,000
I can't stop worrying about her.

174
00:11:08,306 --> 00:11:09,676
You can't cut off your own family.

175
00:11:10,131 --> 00:11:14,464
You've seen that being with Ji Ni means
dealing with that woman too.

176
00:11:15,592 --> 00:11:16,754
If that's how you look at it,

177
00:11:17,838 --> 00:11:20,463
then Ji Ni is family to us too.

178
00:11:22,652 --> 00:11:25,797
When O Reum needed help,
Ji Ni secretly tried...

179
00:11:26,182 --> 00:11:28,285
to donate her bone marrow,

180
00:11:29,021 --> 00:11:30,962
so if we can help her
without anyone knowing,

181
00:11:31,628 --> 00:11:32,741
I want to do that too.

182
00:11:34,632 --> 00:11:36,955
I keep remembering how she jumped
in front of you...

183
00:11:37,560 --> 00:11:38,777
and got stabbed.

184
00:11:39,138 --> 00:11:42,452
I'm grateful to Ji Ni,
but I hate Na Se Ri.

185
00:11:43,563 --> 00:11:45,573
I don't even know what to do
with these feelings.

186
00:11:45,917 --> 00:11:48,725
I'm worried Ji Hu's mom will torment her.

187
00:11:48,832 --> 00:11:50,413
She tormented Mom too.

188
00:11:51,034 --> 00:11:52,188
I suppose she will.

189
00:11:59,011 --> 00:12:00,735
I sent you the photo. Take a look.

190
00:12:09,552 --> 00:12:12,450
- What's this?
- You're unbelievable.

191
00:12:12,916 --> 00:12:14,395
Aren't you even surprised?

192
00:12:15,545 --> 00:12:16,686
Is this real?

193
00:12:17,098 --> 00:12:18,478
What, do you think I photoshopped it?

194
00:12:19,812 --> 00:12:21,958
Who took this photo...

195
00:12:22,631 --> 00:12:24,856
- of the two of them?
- I did.

196
00:12:25,798 --> 00:12:28,509
I stepped out for a moment,
then came back and found them like this.

197
00:12:28,878 --> 00:12:31,920
Just how lonely must Ji Hu have been
to do something like this?

198
00:12:32,605 --> 00:12:34,319
My heart aches for him.

199
00:12:35,699 --> 00:12:37,840
- Mother.
- I told you I don't like you.

200
00:12:38,138 --> 00:12:40,772
I hate your mom and your personality.

201
00:12:41,645 --> 00:12:43,851
Even so, you insisted on moving in,

202
00:12:43,932 --> 00:12:46,457
saying you wanted us to get along.

203
00:12:47,075 --> 00:12:48,075
Fine.

204
00:12:48,492 --> 00:12:50,076
We both made an effort.

205
00:12:50,358 --> 00:12:51,935
I even installed a buzzer,

206
00:12:52,239 --> 00:12:56,251
calling you day and night
to try to get closer to you.

207
00:12:56,518 --> 00:12:57,887
But what did you do?

208
00:12:58,505 --> 00:13:01,553
You covered the buzzer
with layers of tape...

209
00:13:01,555 --> 00:13:02,892
just to shut me out completely.

210
00:13:03,091 --> 00:13:05,371
You tried to snatch Ji Hu
right out of my arms.

211
00:13:05,672 --> 00:13:07,935
- Mother, that's...
- You did the same on my birthday.

212
00:13:08,245 --> 00:13:12,013
You barely said a word,
then just handed me a painting.

213
00:13:13,698 --> 00:13:17,018
I simply can't understand your ways
or your attitude.

214
00:13:19,151 --> 00:13:20,822
And now your mom...

215
00:13:21,488 --> 00:13:25,203
borrowed a whopping 200,000 dollars
from your father-in-law.

216
00:13:25,931 --> 00:13:27,780
And gave it to a murderer, no less.

217
00:13:28,836 --> 00:13:30,845
What is this? Are you filming
a movie in our house?

218
00:13:31,212 --> 00:13:33,533
And then there's your so-called
older brother.

219
00:13:34,027 --> 00:13:36,147
You even took a knife for him,

220
00:13:36,248 --> 00:13:39,027
and miscarried the precious child
of our family.

221
00:13:39,285 --> 00:13:40,490
Meanwhile, my son...

222
00:13:40,752 --> 00:13:44,066
is so busy walking on eggshells around you
that he can't even go into his own room.

223
00:13:44,068 --> 00:13:46,561
Tell me why I should keep
putting up with this...

224
00:13:46,770 --> 00:13:50,036
and continue living with you.

225
00:13:53,112 --> 00:13:54,699
Go on. Tell me.

226
00:13:55,959 --> 00:13:58,295
Now you're keeping your mouth shut again.

227
00:13:59,392 --> 00:14:01,212
Does Ji Hu like Jung A too?

228
00:14:02,119 --> 00:14:03,672
Can't you tell from the picture?

229
00:14:04,258 --> 00:14:06,767
You've pushed Ji Hu away,

230
00:14:06,792 --> 00:14:10,189
so Jung A is comforting his lonely heart.

231
00:14:11,286 --> 00:14:12,680
I understand.

232
00:14:13,334 --> 00:14:14,779
So I just have to disappear.

233
00:14:16,385 --> 00:14:17,852
At least you catch on quickly.

234
00:14:19,765 --> 00:14:21,193
I'm not giving you much time.

235
00:14:22,731 --> 00:14:23,884
Mother,

236
00:14:24,482 --> 00:14:26,516
do you hate me enough to go this far?

237
00:14:27,312 --> 00:14:29,382
How can you be so cruel?

238
00:14:29,630 --> 00:14:30,630
I...

239
00:14:32,844 --> 00:14:35,589
I may not have been born
into a good family,

240
00:14:36,363 --> 00:14:38,166
but that doesn't mean I deserve...

241
00:14:38,829 --> 00:14:41,747
to be treated this way
or looked down on like I'm worthless.

242
00:14:41,772 --> 00:14:44,038
This is exactly why I call you arrogant.

243
00:14:45,252 --> 00:14:46,483
What do you have?

244
00:14:47,118 --> 00:14:49,527
Does your dad even act like a proper dad?

245
00:14:49,738 --> 00:14:52,562
Does your mom know her place
and act with some humility?

246
00:14:52,564 --> 00:14:53,788
Do you have money?

247
00:14:53,790 --> 00:14:55,250
What do you have, exactly?

248
00:14:56,111 --> 00:14:57,260
As for your wedding gifts,

249
00:14:57,761 --> 00:15:01,089
your mom stole the official wife's gold.

250
00:15:01,113 --> 00:15:02,874
You're beyond ridiculous.

251
00:15:03,425 --> 00:15:05,875
Your mom belongs
in the Guinness World Records.

252
00:15:06,052 --> 00:15:07,197
And you're her daughter.

253
00:15:08,018 --> 00:15:10,361
Don't think you're innocent
or that you're the one being wronged.

254
00:15:12,185 --> 00:15:14,015
I've cut ties with my mom.

255
00:15:14,652 --> 00:15:16,199
Can't you judge me on my own merits?

256
00:15:16,792 --> 00:15:17,792
Mother,

257
00:15:18,438 --> 00:15:19,644
I'll do better.

258
00:15:19,669 --> 00:15:21,998
- I'll pull myself together.
- Don't bother.

259
00:15:22,023 --> 00:15:23,567
I don't like you.
I hate everything about you.

260
00:15:23,592 --> 00:15:25,418
If you're grateful for how Ji Hu
has treated you,

261
00:15:25,499 --> 00:15:28,167
and for how your father-in-law
has treated you,

262
00:15:28,372 --> 00:15:30,576
then repay them by leaving.

263
00:15:31,308 --> 00:15:34,127
Stay away from Ji Hu and me.

264
00:16:26,509 --> 00:16:28,709
(Ji Hu)

265
00:16:32,917 --> 00:16:34,365
Don't tell Ji Hu.

266
00:16:34,958 --> 00:16:36,909
You know he'd try to stop you.

267
00:16:37,605 --> 00:16:39,695
He's so blinded by love for you.

268
00:16:40,191 --> 00:16:41,550
What could he possibly say?

269
00:16:41,713 --> 00:16:43,256
It's your decision.

270
00:16:43,512 --> 00:16:46,011
Leave if you want, or stay and endure it.

271
00:16:46,685 --> 00:16:48,236
This is between you and me.

272
00:17:11,625 --> 00:17:12,878
Ji Ni!

273
00:17:12,985 --> 00:17:15,098
Why did you do that?

274
00:17:15,588 --> 00:17:16,748
Do you think I'm a joke?

275
00:17:16,858 --> 00:17:18,242
Are you looking down on me too?

276
00:17:18,659 --> 00:17:19,659
I...

277
00:17:19,762 --> 00:17:21,876
I'm not some bug anyone can stomp on.

278
00:17:22,039 --> 00:17:23,107
I have the papers.

279
00:17:23,132 --> 00:17:25,957
- I can protect myself!
- No, you can't protect yourself.

280
00:17:27,072 --> 00:17:29,376
So stop making Ji Hu's life miserable.

281
00:17:29,571 --> 00:17:31,075
You bring nothing but misery.

282
00:17:31,099 --> 00:17:32,446
You said it yourself.

283
00:17:33,251 --> 00:17:35,715
You even gave a speech at my wedding.

284
00:17:36,014 --> 00:17:37,251
You're my friend.

285
00:17:37,867 --> 00:17:39,904
Ji Hu was only nice to you...

286
00:17:39,955 --> 00:17:41,885
because you're my friend.

287
00:17:43,201 --> 00:17:44,201
I know.

288
00:17:44,518 --> 00:17:45,598
That's what makes me mad.

289
00:17:45,798 --> 00:17:47,251
At clubs, at school,

290
00:17:47,275 --> 00:17:50,564
men came looking for you
and left their gifts with me for you.

291
00:17:51,612 --> 00:17:53,077
And you threw them out.

292
00:17:53,244 --> 00:17:54,344
Right in front of me.

293
00:17:55,092 --> 00:17:58,165
I wished I could have all that,
but you looked sick of it!

294
00:17:58,688 --> 00:18:00,005
You can't stand love?

295
00:18:02,318 --> 00:18:03,318
Love aversion?

296
00:18:03,944 --> 00:18:05,277
That's ridiculous.

297
00:18:05,338 --> 00:18:07,064
Stop whining about having it so good.

298
00:18:07,832 --> 00:18:10,120
Does that justify betraying me like this?

299
00:18:11,060 --> 00:18:14,264
I even begged you
not to see my mother-in-law,

300
00:18:14,289 --> 00:18:16,488
so how could you be in photos like those?

301
00:18:17,539 --> 00:18:18,888
Nice photos, right?

302
00:18:18,972 --> 00:18:20,735
I was so happy.

303
00:18:22,752 --> 00:18:24,546
You won't last in that house.

304
00:18:24,846 --> 00:18:26,422
She's planning to replace you.

305
00:18:26,604 --> 00:18:28,250
She offered me a chance.

306
00:18:29,258 --> 00:18:30,455
And you accepted?

307
00:18:30,791 --> 00:18:33,554
I had no reason not to. I like Ji Hu.

308
00:18:34,838 --> 00:18:35,900
He doesn't feel the same.

309
00:18:36,995 --> 00:18:37,995
Love...

310
00:18:39,979 --> 00:18:41,734
If I can't be loved, I'll love him.

311
00:18:43,127 --> 00:18:44,567
And I can have children.

312
00:18:44,592 --> 00:18:45,764
That will change things.

313
00:18:49,318 --> 00:18:50,742
Why are you doing this too?

314
00:18:51,144 --> 00:18:53,153
Why are you doing this to me?

315
00:18:54,396 --> 00:18:55,548
You really don't know?

316
00:18:56,479 --> 00:18:57,672
Because it's you!

317
00:18:57,909 --> 00:18:59,593
You have no one to protect you!

318
00:19:03,672 --> 00:19:05,187
So this is how your mom felt...

319
00:19:05,212 --> 00:19:07,422
when Yeong Ju slapped her.

320
00:19:09,758 --> 00:19:11,010
Jung A...

321
00:19:12,984 --> 00:19:16,505
You should be the one paying
for what your mom did.

322
00:19:17,472 --> 00:19:18,993
You're a mistress's daughter.

323
00:19:19,878 --> 00:19:21,775
Stay hidden from the world, as you said.

324
00:19:21,948 --> 00:19:23,142
Give it all up and leave.

325
00:19:30,585 --> 00:19:32,502
How could you change this much?

326
00:19:34,552 --> 00:19:37,010
You were the only friend I had.

327
00:19:38,778 --> 00:19:40,389
Think about Ji Hu.

328
00:19:41,384 --> 00:19:43,727
If he stays with you,
he'll always be miserable.

329
00:19:43,752 --> 00:19:45,063
Stuck between you and his mom.

330
00:19:45,698 --> 00:19:47,887
When Ji Hu is with his mom and me,

331
00:19:48,398 --> 00:19:49,398
he feels at ease.

332
00:19:49,583 --> 00:19:51,152
He's happy.

333
00:19:52,152 --> 00:19:54,066
He even smiles and jokes with us.

334
00:19:55,452 --> 00:19:57,356
I like seeing him that way.

335
00:20:33,358 --> 00:20:34,764
I heard you met with Jung A.

336
00:20:37,145 --> 00:20:38,145
Yes.

337
00:20:39,442 --> 00:20:40,641
Where are you going?

338
00:20:49,845 --> 00:20:51,711
Since it's come up, let's settle it.

339
00:20:54,841 --> 00:20:56,061
Put your seal on it and leave.

340
00:20:57,761 --> 00:20:59,761
(Application for Divorce
by Mutual Consent)

341
00:21:21,084 --> 00:21:23,806
(Application for Divorce
by Mutual Consent)

342
00:21:36,887 --> 00:21:39,521
(Ji Hu)

343
00:22:15,431 --> 00:22:16,995
That brat.

344
00:22:17,258 --> 00:22:18,587
She hasn't even called.

345
00:22:18,971 --> 00:22:21,131
She knows my number, that little brat.

346
00:22:34,191 --> 00:22:35,519
Yes, this is Na Se Ri.

347
00:22:36,199 --> 00:22:37,768
Hello.

348
00:22:37,872 --> 00:22:40,519
Sounds great. I'm definitely interested.

349
00:22:41,105 --> 00:22:43,725
I don't have an agency.
I handle everything myself.

350
00:22:44,131 --> 00:22:46,070
Don't worry.

351
00:22:46,493 --> 00:22:47,493
Okay.

352
00:22:47,518 --> 00:22:48,518
Na Se Ri.

353
00:22:48,555 --> 00:22:50,016
Yes.

354
00:23:00,797 --> 00:23:02,063
Looks like she's doing well.

355
00:23:05,115 --> 00:23:07,320
I heard two men fought over her...

356
00:23:07,333 --> 00:23:09,530
- with knives.
- Knives?

357
00:23:09,555 --> 00:23:12,221
And both men were younger than her.

358
00:23:13,889 --> 00:23:16,344
The filming location was a bloodbath.

359
00:23:16,701 --> 00:23:17,804
A bloodbath?

360
00:23:43,498 --> 00:23:45,860
Na Se Ri, don't be scared.

361
00:23:47,118 --> 00:23:48,118
Right.

362
00:23:48,516 --> 00:23:51,198
Let him come. I dare him.

363
00:24:13,404 --> 00:24:14,404
Na Ji Ni?

364
00:24:17,803 --> 00:24:18,871
What are you doing here?

365
00:24:31,992 --> 00:24:34,016
Did you come together?

366
00:24:34,800 --> 00:24:36,049
We met outside.

367
00:24:37,458 --> 00:24:38,458
What are you doing?

368
00:24:39,105 --> 00:24:40,732
My mom won't apologize.

369
00:24:41,492 --> 00:24:42,492
I'm sorry about the gold...

370
00:24:42,799 --> 00:24:44,802
and about her hiding Lee Cheol.

371
00:24:45,761 --> 00:24:47,061
I'm truly sorry.

372
00:24:48,112 --> 00:24:50,214
I stole your dad from both of you.

373
00:24:50,784 --> 00:24:52,307
I'm sorry I made you feel alone.

374
00:24:54,379 --> 00:24:56,255
I know this apology means nothing,

375
00:24:57,378 --> 00:24:58,918
but I feel I should still make it.

376
00:25:00,411 --> 00:25:02,172
What do you think you're doing? Get up.

377
00:25:02,197 --> 00:25:04,854
At least let me apologize for my mom.

378
00:25:05,865 --> 00:25:07,466
I know it won't be enough,

379
00:25:08,286 --> 00:25:09,466
but I'm truly sorry.

380
00:25:11,352 --> 00:25:13,075
You really are stubborn.

381
00:25:13,572 --> 00:25:16,120
I'll pay you back for what my mom stole.

382
00:25:16,145 --> 00:25:18,574
- I'll find a way to repay it all.
- Stop it.

383
00:25:19,492 --> 00:25:21,376
What do you expect us to say to that?

384
00:25:21,394 --> 00:25:22,520
That it's okay?

385
00:25:22,591 --> 00:25:24,967
No, I can't say that.

386
00:25:25,705 --> 00:25:28,495
Neither you nor your mom
can give us those years back.

387
00:25:29,258 --> 00:25:31,461
There's no forgiveness. This is pointless.

388
00:25:31,561 --> 00:25:33,519
Just go. Go live your life.

389
00:25:35,292 --> 00:25:36,431
Mom's right.

390
00:25:37,584 --> 00:25:39,288
We don't hold anything against you.

391
00:25:39,972 --> 00:25:42,320
In fact, we have a lot to thank you for.

392
00:25:42,951 --> 00:25:46,310
We know better than anyone
that you're different from your mom.

393
00:25:47,178 --> 00:25:48,799
But that doesn't mean we can...

394
00:25:49,533 --> 00:25:52,185
see you as just Na Ji Ni.

395
00:25:52,866 --> 00:25:55,182
- When we see you...
- You see my mom, right?

396
00:25:57,818 --> 00:25:58,949
I'm sorry.

397
00:26:01,858 --> 00:26:03,461
You saved O Reum,

398
00:26:04,534 --> 00:26:06,974
and kept Seung Hyun from getting hurt.

399
00:26:07,604 --> 00:26:09,151
We're grateful for all you've done.

400
00:26:09,808 --> 00:26:11,017
Let's leave it at that.

401
00:26:16,584 --> 00:26:17,903
Goodbye.

402
00:26:18,931 --> 00:26:22,121
I came because I felt
I owed you a proper goodbye.

403
00:27:18,971 --> 00:27:19,971
Will you...

404
00:27:20,388 --> 00:27:21,669
marry me?

405
00:27:39,448 --> 00:27:40,448
See you again.

406
00:28:55,140 --> 00:28:58,348
(Family Register)

407
00:28:58,367 --> 00:29:00,111
Divorce? Where is Ji Ni now?

408
00:29:00,136 --> 00:29:01,590
So you knew nothing about this?

409
00:29:01,615 --> 00:29:04,623
If she left the papers,
shouldn't we assume it's what she wants?

410
00:29:04,648 --> 00:29:06,942
Then why did she leave?
What did you do to her?

411
00:29:06,967 --> 00:29:09,024
Why does Ji Ni always have to
keep her head down?

412
00:29:09,049 --> 00:29:10,246
It's all your fault, Mother!

413
00:29:10,271 --> 00:29:11,652
What if Ji Ni never comes back?

414
00:29:11,677 --> 00:29:12,912
Will you agree to the divorce?

415
00:29:12,937 --> 00:29:14,040
Honestly, I'm not sure.

416
00:29:14,065 --> 00:29:15,924
Maybe she really wants to leave me.

417
00:29:15,948 --> 00:29:17,410
Hide well.

418
00:29:17,435 --> 00:29:18,944
Don't let anyone find you.

419
00:29:19,690 --> 00:29:21,690
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
